    "summary": "Cloth composed of seven indigo dyed cotton narrow strips hand sewn together selvedge to selvedge, and with a fringe of twisted warps. Along the selvedges the cloth is embroidered by zig-zags in red, yellow and turquoise. The strips are divided into four sections decorated with red embroidery forming a chain of oblongs and diamonds. At the joins of each section there are eight button hole stitches.",
